<mxCell id="c17" value="Each step returns a small object your code routes. A changelog that succeeds is still a draft a person edits — a release note is a claim about the product. A detection decision is never coupled to a publish decision." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;align=center;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="354" width="820" height="40" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
